113
00:12:59,155 --> 00:13:01,655
蛹のままで眠る魂を
My soul sleeping like a chrysalis,

114
00:13:01,655 --> 00:13:04,155
食べかけのまま捨てたあの夢を
that half-eaten, abandoned dream...

115
00:13:04,155 --> 00:13:07,155
もう一度取り戻せ
I will reclaim it once more!

116
00:13:08,655 --> 00:13:25,655
Oh oh oh...

117
