135
00:14:21,655 --> 00:14:23,655
何も言えず僕は歩いた
and unable to say anything, I walked on.

136
00:14:23,655 --> 00:14:27,655
だから僕は音楽を辞めた
[Title: Because I Quit Music]

137
00:14:38,955 --> 00:14:41,155
考えたってわからないし<
I've thought about it, but I still don't understand,

138
00:14:41,155 --> 00:14:43,155
青春なんてつまらないし
and youth is just so boring anyway.

139
00:14:43,155 --> 00:14:44,955
辞めたはずのピアノ
The piano I was supposed to have quit,

140
00:14:44,955 --> 00:14:46,955
机を弾く癖が抜けない
yet I can't break the habit of tapping my desk.

141
00:14:46,955 --> 00:14:48,955
ねえ、将来何しているんだろうね
Hey, what will I be doing in the future?

142
00:14:48,955 --> 00:14:50,655
音楽はしてないといいな
I hope I'm not making music.

143
00:14:52,655 --> 00:14:54,155
困らないでよ
Don't look so troubled.

144
00:14:54,155 --> 00:14:56,155
心はどうだ
How is your heart?

145
00:14:56,155 --> 00:14:58,155
体に
Within your body,

146
00:14:58,155 --> 00:14:59,655
一つず
one by one...

147
00:15:00,608 --> 00:15:01,908
引いても
...even if I drew a line...

148
00:15:01,908 --> 00:15:04,008
どうしても消えなかった
...it wouldn't disappear no matter what.

149
00:15:04,008 --> 00:15:05,708
今更なんだから
It's too late now, so...

150
00:15:05,708 --> 00:15:07,108
なぁ、もう
